;; Issue #5499: a define imported from another module, used as a top-level
;; HOF callback, must run. The module define is inlined into the file's IR
;; module without tree-walker bridge data, so map/filter must reach it
;; through the interpreter that owns it instead of denying the call.
;; expect: (2 4 6)
(require "tests/fixtures/hof_module_callback_mod.aura" all:)
(display (map doubled (list 1 2 3)))
(newline)
(display (filter over-two? (list 1 2 3 4)))
(newline)
